+ * light gain, not an encoded offset. The other admitted transitions only select, move,
+ * scale or mix the two clips' pixels (or, for dipToColorDissolve, a decoded authored
+ * colour), so their page arithmetic is run unchanged on premultiplied linear light with
+ * the SDR display clamps lifted. Inputs are premultiplied before filtering; output is
+ * straight rgba16float with binary16 coverage. Stylised and noise-driven operators
+ * (glitch, sparkles, light leak, chromatic, ...) stay refused.
